# Ars Magica Definitive Edition, Houses of Hermes: True Lineages — House Bonisagus (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Houses of Hermes: True Lineages (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter One (pp. 4–34)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

