> magi. The chapter’s mechanics are structured records elsewhere — House Acclaim, folios, Intrigue,
> Original Research and the four Example Discoveries in `armdef-houses-true-lineages-0.5-bonisagus.ttrpg`;
> the new Virtues and Flaws in `armdef-houses-true-lineages-0.5-virtues-flaws.ttrpg`; the sidebars as
